alse},{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是原书 §13.6.1 的 quadratic pseudo-Boolean function。[[27-df-quadfunc]] 是 Chapter 5 的 quadratic Boolean function，按存在二次 DNF 定义。两种“二次”不能互换。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\mid\\deg(q)\\leq2\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1213,"backlinks":[{"id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-submodular]]）；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$c_q$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]），二次系数符号判据（see [[27-thm-quadsubmodchar]]）。"},{"id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Definitions 5.1–5.2。二次约束作用于所存在的 DNF 项长度，允许常数、一次项，不要求给定的任意 DNF 都是二次。它与实多线性次数≤2的 [[27-df-quadpb]] 不同。"},{"id":"057daf715bc20324","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n,\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n,\\deg$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]], [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-pbdeg]]）。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-quadpb|df-quadpb — Quadratic pseudo-Boolean function]]"},{"id":"107965fb6156fc4c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"目录中仍可定位的主要约定入口是 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-df-unate]]、[[27-df-quadfunc]]、[[27-df-quadpb]]、[[27-df-mindnf]] 与 [[27-df-irredundant]]。这些节点分别保留 Horn 的零方程约定、正性与 unate 的区别、两种二次性，以及最少表示与不可约表示的区别。各节点中的旧来源字段只作为原附件的来源记录保留；缺少对应 PDF 时，字段存在不等于本次已核验源文。"},{"id":"161a56e49197d812","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]]）；$(-q)(x)=-q(x)$ 对所有 $x\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{PBOpt},\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。"},{"id":"fb0ee9f563db54d8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$I=\\{(i,j)\\in N^2:i<j\\}$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（见 [[27-df-quadpb]]）。$c\\in\\mathbb R$，$a:N\\to\\mathbb R$，$b:I\\to\\mathbb R$，满足 $\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(q(x)=c+\\sum_{i\\in N}a_ix_i+\\sum_{(i,j)\\in I}b_{ij}x_ix_j)$。"},{"id":"366105e2ddae92b9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]]）和 $\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。"}],"outgoing":["476d67d753efdb3f","923be44c9742df37"]}